            <pb edRef="inst:4668" n="2b"/><lb edRef="inst:4668" n="2b8"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex29012025-03-2811-47-44" status="finalized"><rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="person:4593"><rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:unnamed_reference" ref="work:7338">ti ka</rs>'i 'dod pa kha <lb edRef="inst:4668" n="2b9"/> cig</rs> sun 'byin pa yod te <rs type="person" ref="person:6971" ana="corpusmd:named_reference">rom po</rs>'i zhal nas de rnams spangs pa'i brjod bya logs pa myi rnyed mdo' nas kyang chos lnga dag dang rang bzhin gsum || rnam par shes pa brgyad nyid dang || bdag myed gnyis kyi nang du ni || theg chen mtha' dag 'dir 'dus ces gsungs te dngos po lnga dang mtshan nyid gsum don gcig | gang zag gsum dang sbyar ba 'di 'thad pa 'aM
         <pb edRef="inst:4668" n="3a"/><lb edRef="inst:4668" n="3a1"/> man ngag yin |</seg><gap reason="omitted"/><lb edRef="inst:4668" n="3a8"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex29012025-03-2811-47-442" status="finalized"><rs type="person" ref="person:6971" ana="corpusmd:named_reference">rom po</rs> ni mgu' dka' ba la gsung | <note type="gloss"> chos ni lung dang rtogs pa las rtogs pa | de'i yang laM 'bras bu las 'bras bus (stengs/ste sa) dang pha rol du phyin pa'o | de yang ming du bcu rdzas su drug go | dka' ba ni nyaMs su blang par dka' bas ste pa ra re re (pas) bsgrub bar dka' ba'o | gzhan don rgya che ba rang don bab pa'o |</note> de ltar na'ang mgu' bar myi nus so snyam na | rad na'i dpes a rya'i nor la spyod pa'i yon tan ston te | dper na rad na <note type="gloss">kha dog dbyibs tshad rigs</note> chos bzhi dang ldan pa la lta mi shes pa rnams myi mgu' | lta shes pa rnams <note type="gloss">de °°°°°°'dod pa °° rdzogs</note> mgu' ba bzhin du | chos 'di la'ang nyan rang gi rigs can mi <lb edRef="inst:4668" n="3a9"/> mgu' ste theg chen gyi rigs can mgu ba'o |</seg> 
          <gap reason="omitted"/>

            
            
            
            
            
            <pb edRef="inst:4668" n="6a"/><lb edRef="inst:4668" n="6a6"/><seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex29012025-03-2811-47-443" status="finalized"><rs type="person" ref="person:6971" ana="corpusmd:named_reference">rom po</rs> ni yon tan <expan>thams cad</expan> kyi pha mthar phyin par byed pas sgrol bar bzhed do || </seg><gap reason="omitted"/>
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
